        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/d2d74fc12aac7f54f9e922bf12f8e5e3.avif?t=1776640894\" width=1560 height=425 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/67a41e0ffb367db7b607074882050b75.poster.avif?t=1776640894\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/67a41e0ffb367db7b607074882050b75.webm?t=1776640894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/67a41e0ffb367db7b607074882050b75.mp4?t=1776640894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a sinister game of poker dice against blood-thirsty demon billionaires who’ve trapped you on their mega yacht in this rogue-like dice builder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been forcefully stranded aboard The Avarice in order to participate in an underground tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a way to win several rounds of a sadistic poker dice game that the elites have concocted on their luxury mega yacht.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to break the cycle, or will the body count keep rising?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/e2f8f7ba9947a9b863f151a9384bb93a.avif?t=1776640894\" width=640 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/d8e6914ab17c28e69a974537f545731e.poster.avif?t=1776640894\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/d8e6914ab17c28e69a974537f545731e.webm?t=1776640894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/d8e6914ab17c28e69a974537f545731e.mp4?t=1776640894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll your five dice to get the highest poker hand. Each round gives you 3 re-rolls. The player with the highest hand wins the round. Play until you've cleaned out your opponent - or your opponent cleans you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/13a29101c14b9b06197c8d2eaf0c15b5.avif?t=1776640894\" width=640 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/65c74108885622dcfc668aa1320ba599.poster.avif?t=1776640894\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/65c74108885622dcfc668aa1320ba599.webm?t=1776640894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/65c74108885622dcfc668aa1320ba599.mp4?t=1776640894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place bets by cutting off your own fingers - or watch as the boss loses theirs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/1d3b94e56951707dc06779c19388dac3.avif?t=1776640894\" width=640 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/426763ede31b9ab7e2c245f8197a425a.poster.avif?t=1776640894\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/426763ede31b9ab7e2c245f8197a425a.webm?t=1776640894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/426763ede31b9ab7e2c245f8197a425a.mp4?t=1776640894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose the game, lose your life - get tossed overboard and replaced with a new poor soul, and start again. Another match lost is another notch on the body count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/9a991f4db26089268043905cc483fa14.avif?t=1776640894\" width=640 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/545aee985302c3b5099a2c169e83fdff.gif?t=1776640894\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/545aee985302c3b5099a2c169e83fdff.poster.avif?t=1776640894\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember to hide away your best resources in the hidden compartment of your cell for the next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/8d57a0b7e5864e1ca5f124b48abe6344.avif?t=1776640894\" width=640 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/bff946349f56438398c8a85acbd35579.poster.avif?t=1776640894\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/bff946349f56438398c8a85acbd35579.webm?t=1776640894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/bff946349f56438398c8a85acbd35579.mp4?t=1776640894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rig your dice up with demonically sealed special abilities crafted using materials and fingers you've won through poker games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock charms and curses for your dice that allow you to build a strategy towards defeating your opponents and rigging the game in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/5464542499994741f33a0cae3bf7a376.avif?t=1776640894\" width=640 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/extras/55c8fc60cd160db50aaf8ff5cadbabe5.poster.avif?t=1776640894\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://sh